ounty has 75 years of record on its 6 grids, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, July to August ran 57% of normal and November to December ran 46%. The preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 on grid 17565 is 32.9, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
